      "content": "That's a pretty strong stance. Some critics argue that these programs can actually lead to resentment among staff or even legal challenges regarding reverse discrimination, and they say the data connecting DEI to profitability is often correlational rather than causal. Why do you think those concerns are less valid than the benefits you mentioned?",
